<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8072" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cinnămōmum</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cinnămum</span></b> , or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cinnămon</span></b> ,
		i, n. (post-class. access. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cinnămus</span></b> ,
		i, m., <i><span class="en">Sol. 33</span></i>,
		in the signif. of ll.), = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κινναμωμον</span> or
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίνναμον</span> [], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>cinnamon</i>: Laurus
			cinnamomum, Linn. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b>
			Cinnamomum, <i><span class="en">Plin. 12, 19, 42</span></i>,
			§§ 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">85 and 86. —As a term of endearment:
					tu mihi stacte, tu cinnamomum, tu rosa, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Curc. 1, 2, 8</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			Cinnamum, <i><span class="en">Plin. 12, 19, 42, § 86 sq.</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Ov.
				M. 10, 308</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 4, 13, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Stat. S. 4,
				5, 32</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(g).</b> Cinnamon, <i><span class="en">Prop. 3</span></i> (4), 13, 8; <i><span class="en">Luc. 10,
				166</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Meton.</b> for <i>twigs of
				cinnamon; plur.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cinnama,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 15, 399</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">10, 308</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. F. 3,
				731</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Stat. S. 2, 6, 88</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Claud. Laud. Stil. 2,
		420</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
